      "what_it_would_require": "≥30 sessions, ≥120 turns AND ≥36 binding-dependent turns, all in half B's share alone (ROADMAP-v0.21 §1.1)",
      "why_it_is_published_rather_than_omitted": "the prereg resolved the discrepancy in writing BEFORE recording and gave its reasons. Publishing the number the other reading would have produced is what turns that resolution from a convenient choice into a checkable one — and it is the number a reader who prefers the roadmap's wording needs in order to disagree with the prereg on the evidence."
